# The public S3 bucket this build reads the published notes out of — one per
# environment. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to point a local `npm run dev`
# at the dev bucket; CI sets it per environment from the repository variables
# DEV_NOTES_BASE_URL / PROD_NOTES_BASE_URL (see .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
#
# A build without it still runs: /notes simply says it was not told where the
# notes are.
VITE_NOTES_BASE_URL=https://fretbook-notes-dev.s3.eu-west-3.amazonaws.com
